<Base title="Referral & Price Disclosure | Litbuy Sheet Lab" description="Understand referral links, historical reference prices and the independent role of Litbuy Sheet Lab."><main class="long-guide information-page"><h1>Referral and price disclosure</h1><h2>Independent website</h2><p>Litbuy Sheet Lab is an independent product-discovery site and is not the official Litbuy website. Platform names and logos identify the linked services. Their use does not establish endorsement or a partnership.</p><h2>Referral identifiers</h2><p>Some registration and buying links contain referral or partner identifiers. The operator may receive referral benefits when a visitor registers or buys through an eligible link. The presence of a link is not a guarantee of product quality, authenticity, availability or platform service.</p><h2>Reference prices</h2><p>Catalog prices are historical CNY references. Converted amounts are estimates using the displayed rate date; they are not live Litbuy quotes. Platform exchange rates may differ. Domestic delivery, purchasing/service charges, international shipping, taxes and optional services are not included unless the platform explicitly says otherwise.</p><h2>Your decision</h2><p>Compare the current seller listing, selected options, platform fees, return terms and shipping restrictions before paying. Inspect the warehouse photos supplied for your actual order before shipping.</p></main></Base>
